{"id":"vod_hh_57017","vodId":"57017","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"红莲之王","name_cn":"红莲之王","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/16cba01e083801067db052ea5cfd254c.jpg"},"summary":"舞台是2030年的东京。东京近郊一带突然观测到了高频率的共鸣音，同时城市被红雾覆盖。而且，听到这声音的，不论动物还是人类，全都失去了意识。随着首都机能的麻痹，政府暂时将首都机能移往大阪，并预测这一现象为实体不明的病毒，出于对瘟疫的担忧而封锁了东京。但就在这一“大共鸣”发生6天后，失去意识的人们好像什么都没发生过一样地醒来了。之后，封锁都市·东京逐渐取回了城市机能，但以这一天为分界线，各种各样的“异常事件”开始发生，人们开始接连被更进一步的非日常所侵蚀。在此之中，还存在着解放了隐藏在血中的力量、觉醒为“英血之器”的年轻人们——他们被彼此的力量所吸引，不容拒绝地相遇，心灵相通，互相杀害，逐渐被残酷的命运连环所吞噬。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-09 17:00:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOGrjRa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/kazAGDqe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKGnNGa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQXwlGe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb427rJe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Yerpwr2b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepn0Dyb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXPEGVe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejBlw4e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMXpPme/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZgJKga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVWBqza/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:10.383Z"}